<view class="guide-page">
  <view class="guide-hero"><view class="guide-kicker">我的方案</view><view class="guide-title">把“感兴趣”变成下一步行动。</view><view class="guide-subtitle">集中保存学校、费用依据、当前状态和待确认问题。数据仅保存在本机。</view></view>
  <view class="guide-plan-list" wx:if="{{schools.length}}">
    <view class="guide-plan-card" wx:for="{{schools}}" wx:key="slug">
      <view class="guide-tier-label {{item.editorialTier === 1 ? 'first' : ''}}">{{item.editorialTier === 1 ? "第一梯队 · 编辑分类" : "已加入方案"}}</view>
      <view class="guide-section-title">{{item.name}}</view><view class="guide-section-note">{{item.curriculumText}}</view>
      <view class="guide-cost-value">{{item.costText}}</view>
      <picker range="{{statusOptions}}" data-slug="{{item.slug}}" bindchange="setStatus"><view class="guide-picker">当前：{{item.status}}</view></picker>
      <input class="guide-input" value="{{item.note}}" data-slug="{{item.slug}}" bindblur="setNote" placeholder="记录要确认的问题" />
      <view class="guide-action-row"><button class="guide-action secondary" data-slug="{{item.slug}}" bindtap="openSchool">查看详情</button><button class="guide-action secondary" data-slug="{{item.slug}}" bindtap="remove">移出方案</button></view>
    </view>
    <button class="guide-action" bindtap="goConsult">提交人工评估</button>
  </view>
  <view class="guide-empty-card" wx:else><view class="guide-section-title">你的选校方案还是空的。</view><view class="guide-section-note">在学校目录或智能选校结果中点击“加入方案”。</view><button class="guide-action" bindtap="goAssessment">开始智能选校</button></view>
</view>
<guide-nav active="plan" />
